# Project

Text- and event-driven football management sim (no 3D). Full PRD lives at
`docs/PRD.md` — consult it for anything touching scope, priorities, or
architecture; don't re-derive decisions that are already made there.

Core idea: an event-driven match engine is the single source of truth,
consumed by both a live text commentary feed and a 2D top-down pitch
visualization (SVG, icons/dots + ball). Keep these two presentation layers
in sync by having both read the same event stream — never hand-roll a
separate visual-only or text-only simulation path.

The player runs the club as a business, not just a sporting operation:
club economy (finances, matchday commerce, a simple non-3D stadium editor,
league TV/prize money) is a first-class pillar, on par with tactics and
transfers.
